    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The bitterest tears shed over graves are for words left unsaid and deeds
    left undone. At a dark era where death consistently occurs and justice is nowhere
    to be found. This is the daily life of peasants everywhere. Including a town
    of Ashdale where people find peace secluded at the forest far from any territories
    that may occupy them. They managed to get by everyday by farming crops and fishing
    at a nearby lake. It wasn\u2019t much but they were in peace. "
